{"id":"00197","root":"uni00197_1","name":{"ja":"アンジェ","en":"Ange"},"title":{"ja":"【ジューンブライド】","en":"【June Bride】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ジューンブライド】 アンジェ","en":"【June Bride】 Ange"},"aliases":["Angers"],"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-05-31","limited":true,"characterId":29,"profile":{"ja":"米連の改造人間。魔族や対魔忍の力を移植されている。米連の施設で兵士として育てられ、戦闘経験も多い。集団戦が得意で、背中から無数の触手を出して多数の敵を葬り去る。大人ばかりの環境で育ったせいか、自分の感情を押し殺しがちで、自分の気持ちを素直に口に出すのは苦手である。そんな彼女に惹かれ、応援したい気持ちを抱いてしまった者たちにより、「Ａ・Ｂ・Ｇ」（Ａｎｊｅ・Ｂｏｄｙ・Ｇｕａｒｄ）通称『アンジェ親衛隊』なる組織が自然発生。米連や対魔忍、魔族の枠を超えて団員数は密かに増えているとか。ちなみに彼女自身はそんな組織があることを知らない。","en":"(Ange, she/her) She is a modified human from the United States, implanted with the powers of demons and Taimanin. Raised as a soldier in a U.S. facility, she has abundant combat experience and excels in group battles, unleashing countless tentacles from her back to lay waste to hordes of enemies. Growing up among adults, she tends to suppress her emotions and struggles to speak her feelings honestly. Drawn to her, a group of supporters formed a naturally arising organization called \"A·B·G\" (Ange Body Guard), commonly known as the \"Ange Guard Corps.\" Though it now quietly expands beyond the bounds of the United States, Taimanin, and demons, Ange herself remains unaware of the group's existence."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"三十三七","forms":[{"id":"uni00197_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1012,2024],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[140,280],"def":[112,224],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","210001"],"evolve":[["evo00013",5],["evo00014",15],["evo00015",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00197_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1524,3048],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[215,430],"def":[159,318],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","210001","210002"],"evolve":[["evo00014",10],["evo00015",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00197_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","leve