ybe… a special treat?\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"一応、結婚にもお嫁さんにも興味はある……したいかどうかは、まだわからない","en":"I guess I'm somewhat interested in marriage and being a bride… I just don't know if I actually want it yet."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"してくれって言われたら……それは……嬉しい？　と、思う……嬉しい","en":"If you asked me to do it… that would… make me happy? I think… happy."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00197_1/uni00197_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle 